// Whole-Program Closed-World Reachability, `.axmeta` Summary Serialization, Symbol Internalization,
// Cross-Module LTO Inlining/Specialization/Escape/Alias/Devirtualization, and Generic Monomorphization Deduplication (T621 / E15.6).
// Implements SPEC-75 §§1, 2, 5, 6 (AXS-LTO-001..005, AXS-LTO-010..015, AXS-LTO-024, AXS-LTO-025, AXS-LTO-030, AXS-PGO-015;
// REQ-OPT-257..258, REQ-OPT-261..282, REQ-OPT-320, REQ-OPT-375..376, REQ-OPT-379..380; ALTO-20..41, ALTO-47..50):
//   - Explicit LTO execution modes (`LTO_MODE_OFF`, `LTO_MODE_THIN`, `LTO_MODE_FAT` / `LTO_MODE_FULL`) & `WorldScope`
//     (`WORLD_CLOSED`, `WORLD_PARTIAL`, `WORLD_OPEN`) (`AXS-LTO-001..004`)
//   - Per-module `.axmeta` `LtoModuleSummary` binary serialization/deserialization & 64-bit/128-bit semantic digests
//     with partition-level `ThinLTO` incremental invalidation (`lto_thin_partition_needs_rebuild`) (`AXS-LTO-002`, `ALTO-47`)
//   - Whole-program closed-world reachability & non-exported `pub` symbol internalization (`lto_internalize_symbols`,
//     `lto_compute_reachability`, `lto_prune_unreachable`) from formal root set $R_{root}$ (`Entry`, `Export`,
//     `DynamicLookup`, `FfiCallback`, `Reflection`, `PinnedAt`, `ModuleInit`) + Rapid Type Analysis (`RTA`) (`AXS-LTO-005`, `AXS-LTO-010`)
//   - Cross-module `OptIR` inlining, constant/closure specialization, `EffectSummary`/`FunctionEscapeSummary`/`AliasSummary`
//     propagation (`UnknownAlias` fail-closed barrier, `atomic` & `volatile`/`@at` MMIO preservation), and closed-world
//     `dyn Trait` / indirect function-pointer devirtualization (`lto_run_cross_module_opt`) (`AXS-LTO-011..013`, `AXS-LTO-015`)
//   - Cross-module generic monomorphization deduplication (`lto_deduplicate_generics`) merging identical instances and
//     representation-equivalent (`RepEquivDesc`) instances while preserving distinct observable function addresses whenever
//     `address_taken_fn == true` or `has_custom_drop == true` (`AXS-LTO-014`, `ALTO-30..33`)
//   - `PassManager` `TransformationContract` (`PASS_LTO = 18u16`) and deterministic `--emit=lto` (`lto_print`) (`AXS-LTO-030`, `AXS-PGO-015`)
module compiler.opt.lto

